silm:instances_papers_07_the_canonical_question_chapters_06_domain_entry_points_sections_04_bioinformatics_entry_yoneda_hom_leg_1 silm:hasExample "In 'P07DomainEntryPointsBioinformaticsEntryYonedaHomLeg1', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, VetRecord_77 is the clinical-record information artifact about Mittens; it depicts Mittens via a typed aboutness arrow and is not itself the cat." .
